{"rowNumber":1099,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1099","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくは密着していた水蓮姉の身体を押しのけるほど強く――\nその最奥に向かって射精した。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1107,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1107","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁぁぁっっ……！！　あぁん、んはぁぁ……！！\nす、すごい、んぁあっ、射精っ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1113,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1113","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「すごすぎて、はぁ、はぁ……！！　お腹、いっぱいになっちゃう……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1124,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1124","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「そんなに、興奮してくれてたん、だね……？\nんぁ、はぁはぁ、私にも、ああぁん、こんなに……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1129,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1129","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、当たり前だよ……。\n水蓮姉とエッチして、はぁ、興奮しないわけない」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1134,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1134","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……嬉しい。私も興奮しっぱなしだった」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1139,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1139","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「また私とも、しようね？　３人で、っていうのも、いいかもね」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1148,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1148","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「……愛してる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1152,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1152","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「う、うん……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1155,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1155","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膣内に感じる精子の熱さと量をうっとりと感じながら、\n水蓮姉が幸せそうにぼくを見つめてきてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1159,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1159","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"射精の余韻に浸りながら、そのドキっとする水蓮姉の\n蕩け顔に釘付けになっていると――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1164,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1164","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「……私も、愛してるよ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1167,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1167","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"紫苑が切なげな顔でぼくを見つめているのに気がついた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1171,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1171","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんにだって負けないくらい、好きだよ……？\n大好き……愛してる……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1176,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1176","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「紫苑……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1180,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1180","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ごめん……やっぱり隣でイチャイチャされると妬いちゃうかも……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1184,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1184","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ、心配しないで、紫苑」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1188,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1188","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「お、お姉ちゃん……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1192,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1192","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ほらよく見て？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1196,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1196","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あんなに出したのに……まだまだ元気いっぱい。\n私たちのこと、まとめてもっと愛してくれるみたい」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1201,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1201","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あ……本当だ。あんなに勃起させちゃって……ホント、スケベ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1204,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1204","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の言葉を聞いて、切なげだった紫苑の顔が和らぐ。\nむしろ嬉しそうにぼくとぼくのちんこを見つめてきてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1209,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1209","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「そうね……お姉ちゃんの言う通りかも。\n私たちの、愛する人だもんね。\n二人揃って愛してくれる人だもんね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1215,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1215","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ、そういうこと」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1219,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1219","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「二人揃って……ふふ。幸せになろ？\n私たちも二人揃って、幸せにしてあげるの」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1224,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1224","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「うん。お姉ちゃん」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1227,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1227","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そうして紫苑と水蓮姉が二人揃って\nお尻をいやらしく突き出してきてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1233,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1233","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「……もっとおちんちん挿れて……？\n私たちのこと、めちゃくちゃにして……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1239,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1239","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「向こうに帰っちゃう前に、はぁはぁ、刻み込んで欲しいな……？\nあなたの愛を……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1243,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1243","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"姉妹揃って淫らにお尻を振って誘惑してくれる。\n淫靡な表情で、トロトロのおまんこを見せつけてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1248,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1248","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「責任も、取ってもらわなきゃ……。\n姉妹揃って、こんなにスケベにしちゃった責任……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1253,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1253","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私たち二人とも……もう離れられないよ、心も体も……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1257,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1257","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、紫苑……水蓮姉……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1260,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1260","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"淫らな空気を身に纏う２人に当てられて、あれだけ精液を吐き出している\nちんこに、更なる血流が送り込まれていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1265,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1265","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「今夜は三人で一晩中えっちする？\n私とお姉ちゃんと……何も考えられなくなるぐらい」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1270,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1270","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「一晩中だなんて、ふふ。無理は禁物、だよ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1273,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1273","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"二人が火照った瞳を向けてくる。\n煮えたおまんこを突き出して、期待するような視線を送ってくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1277,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1277","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ああ、ここは本当に──","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1288,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1288","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁっ――あぁぁぁあああああんんんっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1291,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1291","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"楽園だ――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1296,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1296","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁあんっ、あっ、はぁっ、ああんっ……！！\nふああっ、あっ、気持ちいい、はぁんっ、\nおちんちんまだまだ太くて硬くて……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1303,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1303","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「もっと、はぁあんっ、激しくしてっ？\n私のおまんこっ、あっ、あっ、壊れるくらい激しく、突いてっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1308,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1308","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「おっぱいもぎゅうって、跡が付いちゃっても、いいからっ……！！\nめちゃくちゃに、あぁんっ、めちゃくちゃにして」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1313,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1313","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ホントに紫苑はっ、ぼくのこと言えないぐらいスケベだっ！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1319,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1319","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁぁ、ああああんんんんっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1322,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1322","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"望み通りにちんこで突き上げながら、おっぱいをぎゅっと揉みしだく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1325,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1325","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"すると紫苑はかつてないほど悦びの声を上げた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1329,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1329","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「しょうが、ないの……だって、強く、求められるほうがっ……！！\n私を、欲しがってるって、実感、できるんだもんっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1334,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1334","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「だから、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！\n激しく、して、私に、刻み込んで……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1339,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1339","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「このおちんちんで、あぁあんっ、もっともっと……\n私を、いやらしく変えちゃって、いいから……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1343,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1343","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そう訴える紫苑の身体は確かに昂ぶりを強めていた。\nさっきよりも圧倒的に感度がいいみたいだ……！","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1347,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1347","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"少し強めに突き上げただけでも――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1353,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1353","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あひいぃぃぃぃ！　んっ、んんんんああああ……！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1356,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1356","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"下品でいやらしい声を上げて鳴いてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1361,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1361","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「、はぁはぁ、紫苑だけじゃなくて、\nはぁはぁ、私にもちょうだい……？　おちんちんちょうだい？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1366,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1366","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「っ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1379,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1379","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁっ――あっ、あぁぁああああああっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1382,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1382","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"呼ばれるがままに今度は水蓮姉のおまんこに挿入する。\n先ほどのふわふわ感に加え、もう膣内はぐっちょりと濡れきっていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1386,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1386","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"おまんこにやらしくチュウチュウ吸われて、\n挿れてるこっちの方がスケベな身体にされてしまいそうだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1391,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1391","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふっ、あぁ……んっ、お姉ちゃんでも、気持ちよく、なってっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1395,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1395","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんも、はぁあんっ、幸せだから……！！\n大好きな人とこうして、結ばれて、最高に幸せ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1400,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1400","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「どんどん気持ちよくなっていいからねっ？\nお姉ちゃんは、全部受け止めて、あげるからっ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1405,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1405","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、ふぁっ、あぁ……んっ……あっ、あっ、あああ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1409,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1409","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「っ……！　水蓮、姉っ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1414,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1414","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！あぁああんっ、はぁあああんっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1417,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1417","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"欲望の限り水蓮姉のおまんこを突き上げながら、\nその極上のおっぱいを揉みしだく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1421,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1421","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんな欲望丸出しな行為を水蓮姉は嫌な顔一つせず、\nむしろ嬉しそうに受け入れてくれる。感じてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1426,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1426","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ……！　私にもっ、私にもちょうだい……！！\n切ないの……！！　おちんちんで、埋めてっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1430,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1430","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんなぼくの夢中っぷりを目の当たりにして、\n今度は紫苑が必死に叫んできた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1434,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1434","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"その切なげな顔がまた、ぼくの性欲を煽ってきて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1445,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1445","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あはぁぁぁああんんんんっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1449,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1449","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あああ、あああっ……！！　また挿れてくれてっ……！！\nあっ、あっ、あっ！！　嬉しいっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1453,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1453","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"挿入し直してあげると、紫苑は泣いて悦んだ。\nその性に溺れる淫らな姿に際限なく劣情が昂ぶる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1458,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1458","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんの身体もいいけど、ふぁあっ、あぁんっ……！！\n私の身体もっ、あっ、あっ、たくさん使って欲しいっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1463,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1463","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「、したいこと、望むこと、あぁんっ、なんでもするからっ！\nどんなえっちなことでも、はぁんっ、悦んでするから……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1468,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1468","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「だからこれからも、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ……！！\nたくさんエッチ、してっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1473,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1473","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「私の身体っ、あぁああんっっ……！！！\n独り占めしちゃって、ああああっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1478,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1478","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「うんっ……！！　もちろん……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1481,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1481","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"島に来た当初のツンツン振りが逆転したかのような紫苑の言葉に、\nちんこも暴発寸前だ……本当に今、この瞬間が贅沢すぎる。楽園すぎる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1485,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1485","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"こんなにエッチで可愛い紫苑を……いや、紫苑だけじゃない──","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1489,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1489","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「もちろん、私も紫苑と同じ気持ち……だよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1493,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1493","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「くぅっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1504,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1504","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁぁぁ……！！　あっ、あぁぁぁああんんっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1507,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1507","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"エッチな美人姉妹を、独り占めできるなんて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1511,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1511","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あぁあんっっ！！\nいいよっ、あぁんっ、もっと刻みつけてっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1516,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1516","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私も紫苑もっ、あっ、あぁあんっ、あなたのものだって……！！\nあなただけのものだって、刻みつけてっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1521,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1521","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私たちを、ふぁ、ぁ、あんっ、独り占めしちゃってっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1525,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1525","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「うんっ……わかったよっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1536,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1536","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁっ、あっ、はぁっ、んぁあっっ！！\nイくっ、んんっっ、イくイくぅぅっっ～～！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1543,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1543","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はひぃんっっ！！　あはぁんっ、ああっ！！\nあっ、あっ、あっ、あぁんっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1554,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1554","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"気の向くまま、欲望の赴くまま、\n二つのおまんこに入れ替わり立ち替わり挿入していく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1558,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1558","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"どっちのおまんこも最高で、優劣なんかとても付けられない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1561,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1561","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ただ一つ、はっきりしてるのは――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1568,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1568","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁぁあっ、あぁああんっ！！　あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！\nき、きてる……！！　精液、あぁ、またぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1573,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1573","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「うんっ……！　お姉ちゃんにも、はぁはぁ、わかる……！\nおちんちん、すごく太くなってきてる……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1578,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1578","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「どっちに、はぁんっ、ああぁんっ、出すのっ？\n私、あぁんっ、それともお姉ちゃんっ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1583,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1583","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「紫苑に、はぁはぁ、出してあげてっ？\n私はもう十分愛してもらったからっ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1588,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1588","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「う、ううんっ、お姉ちゃんにっ、あっ、あっ、あっ！！\nお姉ちゃんに出してあげてっ……！！　私はお昼にも、\nふぁあああんっ、たくさん注いでもらったからぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1593,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1593","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そのお互いを思いやる紫苑と水蓮姉の姿に、\n二人への愛情が際限なく高まる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1597,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1597","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"だからこそ、ぼくは――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1601,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1601","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「二人にぶっかけるっ！　ぶっかけるからっっ！！\n二人揃ってぼくので汚すからっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1606,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1606","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「～～っっ！！　うんっ、汚してっ、あぁんっっ！！！\nお姉ちゃんと一緒に、あぁっ、真っ白にしてぇっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1611,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1611","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁっ、嬉しい……！！　私もして欲しいっ、紫苑と一緒にっ！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1615,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1615","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はひぃぁっ！！　らめっ、あああっ、またイくっ、んぁあっ！！\nひ、あああっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1621,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1621","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、私もイっちゃいそう……！！\nんんっ……！！　あああっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1626,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1626","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"挿入していない水蓮姉の身体まで震え始める。\nまるで抽挿している時のような嬌声を上げて感じてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1631,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1631","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁっ、ああああっ、はぁぁああああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1635,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1635","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふぁぁああっ、あぁ、あぁぁああああああっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1639,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1639","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イ、イくっ！　ああああっ、イくぅっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1643,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1643","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私もっ、あああっ、私もイくっ、イっちゃうっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1647,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1647","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「出してっ、んぁああっ、私たち二人に出してっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1651,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1651","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「大好きな人の精液でっ、ああっ、私たちを染め上げてっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1655,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1655","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「あぁっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、ああっ、ああああ――」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1659,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1659","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁあっ、んぁっ、あああっ、ふぁぁあっ、あああああ――」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1662,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1662","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そして、二人の身体がビクンビクンと跳ね上がった瞬間――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1678,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1678","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「イっ、くぅぅぅぅぅぅんんんんっっ！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1682,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1682","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふあ、あああ、ああああああああっっ！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1685,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1685","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ありったけの愛情を込めた精液を、\n大好きな二人に向かってぶっかけた――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1703,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1703","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、はぁ……ん、ふあぁ……！！\nはぁ……はぁ……もの凄くイっちゃった……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1708,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1708","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁはぁ……！！　ふふ、私も……。\n精液かけてもらうだけでイっちゃった……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1712,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1712","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"全身を染め上げる精液の匂いと感触が快感なのか、\n二人は挿入もしていないのにブルブルと身体を震わせている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1717,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1717","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ……精液、かかっただけでも、感じちゃうんだ、二人とも」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1721,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1721","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「そんなの、当たり前よ……はぁ、ふぅ……愛する人の精液、だもん……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1725,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1725","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「紫苑の言う通り、だよ？　この匂いを嗅ぐだけで……、\n身体に染みこんでくるだけで、はぁはぁ、火照っちゃう……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1729,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1729","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"媚薬……確かに愛の媚薬なのかもしれない。\n紫苑と水蓮姉の気持ちはよくわかる。だって――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1734,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1734","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「そっちだって……私とお姉ちゃんの愛液浴びて、\nさっきより火照っちゃってるんじゃないの……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1739,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1739","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「おちんちん……ふふ。また硬くなってきてるよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1743,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1743","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「うっ……お見通しなんだね……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1746,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1746","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ちょっぴり恥ずかしくなりつつも、\n滾っていくちんこは誤魔化しようがなかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1750,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1750","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"それに……二人もまだまだ物足りないみたいだし。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1755,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1755","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……夜はまだまだこれからだもん。\nたくさん、エッチしちゃえばいいじゃない……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1761,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1761","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「なら今度は……ふふ。私と紫苑でご奉仕してあげようよ。お返しに」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1765,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1765","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「うん……流石お姉ちゃん、良い考え」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1768,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1768","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"火照りきった顔で二人が幸せそうに頷き合う。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1772,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1772","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑","english":"","japanese":"「、いいよね……？\n今度は私たちに気持ちよくさせて……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1777,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1777","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「してくれた分……今度は二人で気持ちよくしてあげたいから……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1794,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1794","kind":"text","speaker":"紫苑・水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「「二人でご奉仕……してあげるね？」」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1797,"id":"si24_02h.ks#1797","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"楽園の夜はまだまだ続くのだった――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
